--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Modifications and derived material
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

This is an independent reimplementation of Playwright in Dart. It is not
produced, endorsed, or supported by Microsoft Corporation. The following
files carry material derived from the upstream TypeScript sources and have
been modified:

  packages/playwright_core/lib/src/server/injected/
      injected_script_source.dart
      Hand port of the in-page selector engine and of the aria tree:
      packages/injected/src/ domUtils.ts, selectorUtils.ts, roleUtils.ts,
      roleSelectorEngine.ts, the `internal:*` engines of injectedScript.ts,
      ariaSnapshot.ts and the normalizePlugins of ariaSnapshotDistiller.ts,
      plus packages/isomorphic/stringUtils.ts#normalizeWhiteSpace and the
      yamlEscape* helpers of packages/isomorphic/yaml.ts. The ARIA role
      and attribute tables are reproduced closely; the selector parser and
      the CSS tokenizer are not ported, stability sampling differs, and the
      aria tree covers upstream's `default` mode only (no element refs,
      boxes, active marker, depth limit or iframe descent).

  packages/playwright_core/lib/src/aria_template.dart
      Port of parseAriaSnapshot, KeyParser and textValue from packages/
      isomorphic/ariaSnapshot.ts, plus matchesNode, listEqual, containsList
      and matchesNodeDeep from packages/injected/src/ariaSnapshot.ts. The
      matching runs in Dart over the snapshot tree instead of in the page,
      and `[active]` is rejected instead of matched.

  packages/playwright_core/lib/src/accessibility.dart
      AccessibilityNode mirrors the AriaNode of packages/isomorphic/
      ariaSnapshot.ts, plus the `value` and `description` fields this port
      has carried since before upstream's aria snapshots existed.

  packages/playwright_core/lib/src/server/trace/
      Port of the trace recorder: tracing.ts (the recorder), harTracer.ts and
      the har.ts entry shape (the network stream), serializedFS.ts (the
      ordered writer) and instrumentation.ts (the call metadata), all from
      packages/playwright-core/src/server. trace_events.dart reproduces the
      event shapes of packages/isomorphic/trace/versions/traceV9.ts. The DOM
      DOM snapshotter is ported too: snapshotter_injected.dart is
      snapshotterInjected.ts with the TypeScript removed and the class fields
      moved into the constructor, and snapshotter.dart is snapshotter.ts with
      the streamer installed on first capture instead of through an init
      script, and with a deadline instead of a non-stalling evaluation. The
      screencast recorder is not ported.

  packages/playwright_core/lib/src/server/us_keyboard_layout.dart
      Port of packages/playwright-core/src/server/usKeyboardLayout.ts.

  packages/playwright_core/lib/src/server/mac_editing_commands.dart
      Port of packages/playwright-core/src/server/macEditingCommands.ts.

  packages/playwright_core/lib/src/server/chromium/chromium_switches.dart
      Port of packages/playwright-core/src/server/chromium/
      chromiumSwitches.ts.

  packages/playwright_core/lib/src/registry/browsers_json.dart
      The browser revision table from packages/playwright-core/
      browsers.json, embedded as a Dart string.

  packages/playwright_core/lib/src/registry/registry.dart
      Executable and download path mappings, and the CDN mirror list, taken
      from packages/playwright-core/src/server/registry/index.ts.

  packages/playwright_core/lib/src/server/selectors.dart
      Selector-building behaviour mirrored from packages/isomorphic/
      stringUtils.ts and packages/playwright-core/src/utils/
      isomorphic/locatorUtils.ts.

Other files across packages/playwright and packages/playwright_core are
independent Dart implementations whose behaviour is aligned with named
upstream sources; those alignments are documented in the comments of each
file.

